     "「平台」"
    ]
   ],
   "color": "teal_background"
  },
  {
   "t": "bookmark",
   "id": "ae14fbd0-406b-4ad3-a953-f73ae2c00309",
   "href": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/platforms/overview",
   "title": "Platforms",
   "desc": "Platforms"
  },
  {
   "t": "text",
   "id": "cd7bfb2d-48a3-4267-9634-430542d654bd",
   "r": [
    [
     "介绍指南适用的各个端，一个卡片对应一个端的OS，里面介绍了不同设备的特征，并建议设计师和开发者根据这些特征展开设计或开发。"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "image",
   "id": "80cced65-6ddb-419f-99ea-5f8473cae0b3",
   "r": [
    [
     "Untitled"
    ]
   ],
